# Copy to studio/.env.box (git-ignored: .env.* is in .gitignore) and fill in. How to reach the GPU box as root over SSH:
# a full command prefix that takes the remote command as its last argument. With a jump host, for example:
#   BOX_SSH="ssh griffith ssh -i ~/.ssh/hyperai_ed25519 -o BatchMode=yes -p <port> root@ssh.hyper.ai"
BOX_SSH="ssh -o BatchMode=yes -p 22 root@your-gpu-box"
